{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CevGRarEvk7aUz4uCkced","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on my analysis, I have found:\n\n**Repository Findings:**\n- `Shipment.kt:23-27` — ShipmentStatus enum with CREATED, CONFIRMED, CANCELLED states\n- `ShipmentController.kt:20-56` — REST controller currently has POST /shipments, GET /{id}, GET / endpoints\n- `ApiExceptions.kt:18-24` — Exception classes: ConflictException (409), ResourceNotFoundException (404)\n- `ApiError.kt:31-37` — ErrorCode enum (needs a new code for state transition conflict)\n- `GlobalExceptionHandler.kt` — Centralized exception handling\n\n**Conventions this repository uses:**\n1. Error handling: Throw ApiException subclasses, which are converted to error envelopes by GlobalExceptionHandler\n2. ErrorCode is exhaustive and tests verify against it\n3. Controllers return ResponseEntity or throw exceptions; no service layer\n4. Tests use MockMvc, check status code and error code in response envelope\n\n**Affected files:**\n1. `ApiError.kt` — Add new ErrorCode for transition rejection\n2. `ShipmentController.kt` — Add POST /{shipmentId}/confirm endpoint\n3. `ShipmentControllerTest.kt` — Add tests for confirm (normal, idempotent, cancelled, not found cases)\n\n**Risks:**\n- Idempotency is critical: CONFIRMED→CONFIRMED must succeed silently\n- CANCELLED is terminal and should use 409\n- Missing ErrorCode will fail tests\n\n**Open questions:** None. Requirement is clear on all four cases.\n\n---\n\n```\n<<PHASE:DESIGN>>\n```\n\n**Proposed changes:**\n\n1. **ApiError.kt** — Add `SHIPMENT_CANNOT_CONFIRM` to ErrorCode enum to signal state transition rejection (409).\n\n2. **ShipmentController.kt** — Add `@PostMapping(\"/{shipmentId}/confirm\")` endpoint that:\n   - Finds shipment by ID; throw ResourceNotFoundException if not found\n   - If status is CREATED, update to CONFIRMED and save\n   - If status is CONFIRMED, do nothing (idempotent)\n   - If status is CANCELLED, throw ConflictException with SHIPMENT_CANNOT_CONFIRM\n   - Return the (possibly unchanged) shipment with 200 OK\n\n3. **ShipmentControllerTest.kt** — Add four new test methods:\n   - `confirms a created shipment and persists it` — POST confirm on CREATED, verify 200 and CONFIRMED status\n   - `retry of confirm on already-confirmed shipment succeeds` — POST confirm twice, both succeed\n   - `confirm of cancelled shipment is rejected` — Create, save as CANCELLED via repository, POST confirm, verify 409 and SHIPMENT_CANNOT_CONFIRM code\n   - `confirm of unknown shipment is rejected` — POST confirm on non-existent ID, verify 404 and SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND code\n\n**Alternative considered and rejected:** Creating a ShipmentService class for the confirm logic. Rejected because the controller already does all the work inline (see create() method in ShipmentController), with no abstraction layer. Adding one would break convention and introduce unnecessary indirection.\n\n**Data and error flow:**\n\n| Case | Input | Logic | Output | Status |\n|------|-------|-------|--------|--------|\n| Normal (CREATED→CONFIRMED) | Valid ID, CREATED status | Load, update status, save | Shipment with CONFIRMED | 200 |\n| Idempotent (CONFIRMED→CONFIRMED) | Valid ID, CONFIRMED status | Load, no change, return | Shipment with CONFIRMED | 200 |\n| Cancelled → Conflict | Valid ID, CANCELLED status | Load, throw ConflictException | `{\"error\":{\"code\":\"SHIPMENT_CANNOT_CONFIRM\",...}}` | 409 |\n| Not found | Invalid ID | throw ResourceNotFoundException | `{\"error\":{\"code\":\"SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND\",...}}` | 404 |\n\n**Test strategy:**\n\n| Test | Case | Assertions |\n|------|------|-----------|\n| `confirms_created_shipment_and_persists_it` | Normal transition | Status 200, body status is CONFIRMED, repository confirms save |\n| `retry_of_confirm_on_already_confirmed_shipment_succeeds` | Idempotency | Two POSTs both return 200, second returns CONFIRMED unchanged |\n| `confirm_of_cancelled_shipment_is_rejected` | Invalid state | Status 409, error code SHIPMENT_CANNOT_CONFIRM |\n| `confirm_of_unknown_shipment_is_rejected` | Missing resource | Status 404, error code SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND |\n\n---\n\n```\n<<PHASE:IMPLEMENTATION>>\n```\n\nNow I'll implement the changes. Starting with the ErrorCode enum:"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1890,"cache_read_input_tokens":16964,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1890},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b0804f0b-be99-42a6-bd1a-d53cc7ac2117","uuid":"d9ac79a5-9b67-4b7d-b8be-64f630446822","timestamp":"2026-09-10T18:54:57.830Z","request_id":"req_011CevGRaA4owRKQzmc7qhiK"}
